Hello World!

## Firecrawl crawl example

A tiny "hello world" for [Firecrawl](https://docs.firecrawl.dev): crawl a site
and print the pages it discovers as clean markdown.

```sh
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env          # then add your FIRECRAWL_API_KEY
export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...

python crawl_example.py                          # crawls https://docs.firecrawl.dev
python crawl_example.py https://example.com 10   # custom start URL and page limit
```

Get an API key and read more at https://docs.firecrawl.dev.
